{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 4 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5 x minus 3 y equals negative 14\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x plus y\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["03339314-333b-45bd-9db1-fbc938f4ef5f"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "fb78aa9b-35ff-4d4d-a9c2-77ff2bdd4939", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "55334ed7-1df0-468a-94f0-56ebf66820e0", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "7906d168-8996-4e2b-a2a0-97b5e201351a", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "03339314-333b-45bd-9db1-fbc938f4ef5f", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The first equation in the given system is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 4 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.&nbsp;Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 x\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> in the second equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"5 x minus 3 left parenthesis 4 x right parenthesis equals negative 14\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"5 x minus 12 x equals negative 14\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"minus 7 x equals negative 14\"><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"negative 7\"><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 4 x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 4 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 8\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> in the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x plus y\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 plus 8\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y minus x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, not the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x plus y\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>, not the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x plus y\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></math>.</p>", "externalid": "765f83e6-6d57-4694-82d5-9b2180d80565", "correct_answer": ["D"]}